                                        "sense_id": "c288971e-35e3-337f-b5c5-9a9786b06484",
                                        "entry_id": "b178c394-45a2-3845-abef-daaa4c9d6218",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person who loves humankind in general."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "cdc62a46-3825-3bfc-b15a-f97bb856af1b",
                                        "entry_id": "b178c394-45a2-3845-abef-daaa4c9d6218",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person or institution who seeks to improve the world, especially by monetary gifts."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "27c30120-3634-4941-b9c7-092310ed6385",
                                                "sense_id": "cdc62a46-3825-3bfc-b15a-f97bb856af1b",
                                                "text": "[…]and with a passing vague wonder as to what manner of man the ‘philanthropist’ might be who had more money than he knew what to do with,[…]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f8f7ff34-127a-4b46-915d-cd0a56fad6ae",
                                                "sense_id": "cdc62a46-3825-3bfc-b15a-f97bb856af1b",
                                                "text": "It is not uncommon for young philanthropists to retool their giving as they learn from their mistakes. Many other charities have only a single focus. But it has been jarring to allies of the Chan Zuckerberg Initiative to see such a wholesale discarding and downplaying of its prior work, especially given how public it had been about its goals."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "d3d82f9b-0fe9-4b55-a032-05e8655b3adc",
                        "source_entry_id": "29f6c59b-59d5-3673-81e6-e07ebf34e900",
